TI  - Impacts of nutrient enrichment on coral reefs: new perspectives and implications for coastal management and reef survival
T2  - CURRENT OPINION IN ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - GREAT-BARRIER-REEF
KW  - SCLERACTINIAN CORAL
KW  - WATER-QUALITY
