TI  - Pelagic Subsidies Underpin Fish Productivity on a Degraded Coral Reef
T2  - CURRENT BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - GREAT-BARRIER-REEF
KW  - ENERGY
KW  - VULNERABILITY
KW  - DISTURBANCES
KW  - ASSEMBLAGES
KW  - COMPLEXITY
KW  - PREDATION
KW  - COMMUNITY
