TI  - Weight ratios of the kelps, <i>Alaria esculenta</i> and <i>Saccharina latissima</i>, required to sequester dissolved inorganic nutrients and supply oxygen for Atlantic salmon, <i>Salmo salar</i>, in Integrated Multi-Trophic Aquaculture systems
T2  - AQUACULTURE
LA  - English
KW  - Integrated Multi-Trophic Aquaculture (IMTA)
