TI  - Nutritional exchange in a tropical tripartite symbiosis: direct evidence for the transfer of nutrients from anemonefish to host anemone and zooxanthellae
T2  - MARINE BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - GIANT SEA-ANEMONES
KW  - FREE AMINO-ACIDS
