TI  - Does the limpet <i>Patella cochlear</i> fertilize its own algal garden?
T2  - MARINE ECOLOGY PROGRESS SERIES
LA  - English
KW  - algal gardening
KW  - marine grazer
KW  - plant-herbivore interaction
