TI  - The <i>Ulva</i> connection:: marine algae subsidize terrestrial predators in coastal Peru
T2  - OIKOS
LA  - English
KW  - CARBON-ISOTOPE RATIOS
KW  - GULF-OF-CALIFORNIA
KW  - STABLE-ISOTOPES
KW  - ALLOCHTHONOUS INPUT
